type: software
title: "RiskVoid Security Agent Kit"
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted AI security agent for authorised penetration testing and code review: a planner and a worker
  model, a scoped Kali Linux sandbox with tiers and approvals, hashed evidence, a findings database, client
  reports and an evidence-based benchmark harness.
